## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> `deploy-pipeline.yml` will be **deleted**.
> Replaced by `deploy-qa.yml` and `deploy-prod.yml`.

> [!NOTE]
> The `production` environment approval gate is optional.
> If **Required Reviewers** is set on your `production` environment, the
> `deploy-prod` job will pause for approval before running.
> If not set, it runs automatically on merge to `main`.

