## Proposed Changes

### [DELETE] [`deploy-pipeline.yml`](file:///c:/Users/Ranganathan.9703/Documents/learning/.github/workflows/deploy-pipeline.yml)

---

### [NEW] `deploy-qa.yml`
**Trigger:** `push` to `feature/**`, `fix/**`, `bugfix/**`, `hotfix/**`, `chore/**`

```
on:
  push:
    branches:
      - "feature/**"
      - "fix/**"
      - "bugfix/**"
      - "hotfix/**"
      - "chore/**"
  workflow_dispatch:   # also allows manual trigger if needed

jobs:
  pre-deploy   → deploy-qa   → post-deploy-qa
  (all sequential, all automatic, environment: qa)
```

---

### [NEW] `deploy-prod.yml`
**Trigger:** `push` to `main` (fires when a PR is merged)

```
on:
  push:
    branches:
      - main
  workflow_dispatch:   # also allows manual trigger if needed

jobs:
  pre-deploy   → deploy-prod   → post-deploy-prod
  (sequential, environment: production on deploy-prod)
```

---

